'''Surveillance system tape - 8/08/77''' is a [[Fallout 76 holotapes|holotape]] {{In|FO76}}.
__TOC__
==Location==
The tape is found in the southeast side of [[Welch]], in a destroyed house in the open bedroom, on the ground. It is next to [[Case notes: Duchess]].

==Transcript==
[[File:Surveillance system tape - 80877.ogg|center]]
{{Transcript|text=
'''[[Angie Decland|Agent Danger]]''': {{tooltip|Agent Danger, reporting, ma'am.|Chipper. You're glad to see the woman you're talking to.}}

'''[[Duchess]]''': {{tooltip|Oh, it's Agent Danger today?|Happy to see this little girl, who you know well, but previously went by another name.}}

