'''Agent Danger''': {{tooltip|That doesn't sound like a particularly good cookie, ma'am.|Someone just described you as a &quot;sharp cookie.&quot; You're a bit confused, as that sounds awful.}}

'''Duchess''': {{tooltip|Hmm. I suppose it doesn't. Now, to what do I owe the distinct pleasure?|This little girl lights up your day every time you see her.}}

